OL,3,AHundreds of thousands still without
OL,4,Apower after storms hit US on
OL,5,AThanksgiving
OL,6,
OL,7,FConditions are now expected to improve,
OL,8,Fthough forecasters caution that it will
OL,9,Ftake some time. The West Coast has also
OL,10,Fbeen affected by its own storms.
OL,12,FFlight disruption also persists, with
OL,13,Fhundreds more delays and cancellations
OL,14,Freported on Friday - which is expected
OL,15,Fto be another busy travel day.
